			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"茶博士劉蘇"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 223010101,
					"content": "完了，我講到哪了來著…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010102,
					"content": "講什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 223010103,
					"content": "您好，您這是來聽書的？還是來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010104,
					"content": "我？我在這說書，賺點喝茶的小錢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010105,
					"content": "只是我說的書太多，太雜，說著說著就容易記混…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010106,
					"content": "這不，前幾天一幫客人鬧著要聽講南十字船隊的《海山履雲記》，另一幫鬧著要聽講古華派的《裁雨聲》。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010107,
					"content": "我也是為了賺錢，就每本書挑了段記得的講了點。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010108,
					"content": "#沒想到客人聽上了心，鬧著非要聽後續，不給聽就鬧，{F#妳}{M#你}說這…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010109,
					"content": "這兩本書都是我幾年前講過的，我這回去掏了半天，才掏出來重新看了看，準備開書。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010110,
					"content": "但是，我忘了我上次這兩本書分別講到哪了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010111,
					"content": "您能幫我去問問外面的人我上次講到哪了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010112,
						223010114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010112,
					"content": "我知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 223010113,
					"content": "那您受累。我去問的話，那就是砸我自個的招牌…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010118,
					"content": "我尋思了一下，您能問的人有三位。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010119,
					"content": "一位是<color=#00E1FFFF>茂才公</color>，這位爺是一場書都沒落過。一位是<color=#00E1FFFF>范二爺</color>，也就是這茶樓的老闆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010120,
					"content": "還有一位是<color=#00E1FFFF>江舟</color>小姐，我上次說書的時候，看見她停下來聽了一會，但是沒多久又走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010114,
					"content": "你乾脆從頭講…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 223010115,
					"content": "我也想啊，那不也能賺雙份錢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010116,
					"content": "但是這范二爺，不得把我趕出去嘛…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				},
				{
					"id": 223010117,
					"content": "您受累，幫我去問一嘴吧，問到了回來告訴我，我掂量著開書…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						223010118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "茶博士劉蘇"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2230102,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
